OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the night, with prolonged
OL,7,Fclear spells developing towards dawn,
OL,8,Fallowing some patchy frost to form in
OL,9,Frural spots. A generally cold feel to
OL,10,Fthe night, with a brisk wind along the
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy periods and sunny
OL,14,Fspells throughout the day. Remaining
OL,15,Fdry for most areas. Feeling cool, with
OL,16,Fa brisk easterly wind, particularly
OL,17,Falong the coast where it will be
OL,18,Fstronger.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
